// Refuse to sign when the fee is more than 10% of the total input amount.
//
// `context.fee_percent` is floored to an integer percentage, which is too coarse
// for a sharp threshold; comparing `fee * 10` against `inputs_total` keeps the
// check exact (amounts are in satoshis, so the product cannot overflow i64).
//
// Transactions under the cap are not approved silently: they still go through
// the normal on-device confirmation flow.
if context.fee * 10 > context.inputs_total { fail(); }
